  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. Since <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> represents the number of <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math>-minute segments and <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> represents the number of <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math>-minute segments, the total length of the video is <math alttext=\"1 dot x plus 3 dot y\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&middot;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&middot;</mo><mi>y</mi></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext=\"x plus 3 y\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></math>, minutes. Since the video is <math alttext=\"70\"><mn>70</mn>\n</math> minutes long, the equation <math alttext=\"x plus 3 y equals 70\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></math> represents this situation.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>",
